        <div class="description">
            <p>Marie Anne Chiment is an award-winning designer of costumes and sets for theater, opera,<br>
                and ballet worldwide. She received the Kevin Kline Award for ACE (costumes) and I AM MY OWN WIFE
                (sets and costumes), and the Helen Hayes Award for outstanding design. Her work has appeared at the
                Oregon Shakespeare Festival, Santa Fe Opera, Lyric Opera of Chicago, Kennedy Center, Lincoln
                Center, Arena Stage, and internationally in Spain, Germany, England, Cuba, France, and Japan.
                Featured in Opera News, Entertainment Design, and The Costume Designer’s Handbook, her recent
                credits include
                LES FETES DE THALIE at the Kennedy Center.</p>
